these people actually saw.

237
00:16:33.544 --> 00:16:35.660
- We were under heavy fire.

238
00:16:35.684 --> 00:16:38.421
Extraction wasn't
coming anytime soon.

239
00:16:38.445 --> 00:16:41.379
