272
00:18:16.302 --> 00:18:19.177
I never really let myself
see the big picture.

273
00:18:19.201 --> 00:18:20.201
It's okay.

274
00:18:20.996 --> 00:18:22.204
Alex said the same thing.

275
00:18:23.309 --> 00:18:25.977
But then she showed
me her vision.

276
00:18:26.001 --> 00:18:26.943
- Wait.

277
00:18:26.967 --> 00:18:28.531
